{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291170","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029117001:2":{"text":"你的眼睛一直闭着，是看不到吗？你竟然还准确地清除了魔物？","source_cn":"你的眼睛一直闭着，是看不到吗？你竟然还准确地清除了魔物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD51B7B55AB2A55A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029117002:1":{"text":"看到？我并未失明，放心。","source_cn":"看到？我并未失明，放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA44871A923FE6D4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029117003:1":{"text":"你说话怎么又慢又怪的……无所谓，就算你刚刚没有出手，赛利欧斯大人也一定会来帮我的！","source_cn":"你说话怎么又慢又怪的……无所谓，就算你刚刚没有出手，赛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D39E6ACD6D9C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029117004:1":{"text":"“赛利欧斯”大人……是谁？","source_cn":"“赛利欧斯”大人……是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9399E40A32F2769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029117005:1":{"text":"你怎么这么迟钝。听这个帅气的名字叫就知道，赛利欧斯大人肯定是恶魔啊！","source_cn":"你怎么这么迟钝。听这个帅气的名字叫就知道，赛利欧斯大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3FC379C585174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029117006:1":{"text":"恶魔……？我不曾听过。","source_cn":"恶魔……？我不曾听过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56135D720F08804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029117007:1":{"text":"哼哼，你当然没听过，因为是他们瞎编——不对，是我接收到的指引告诉我的！","source_cn":"哼哼，你当然没听过，因为是他们瞎编——不对，是我接收到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450498353C759220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029117008:1":{"text":"恶魔……不会给予人类指引。","source_cn":"恶魔……不会给予人类指引。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB038997E4686ED3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029117009:1":{"text":"你、你乱说什么呢！恶魔就是会这样的，我肯定比你更懂恶魔好吧！","source_cn":"你、你乱说什么呢！恶魔就是会这样的，我肯定比你更懂恶魔好吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ADE00B7196A1E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029117010:1":{"text":"那个，打断一下。半神斯克嘉莉德大人，您为何在此处？","source_cn":"那个，打断一下。半神斯克嘉莉德大人，您为何在此处？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA94F918CAF909A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029117011:1":{"text":"我，并非特意来到此处，路过而已。魔物攻击她，必须消灭——","source_cn":"我，并非特意来到此处，路过而已。魔物攻击她，必须消灭—